BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_317134080@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061840Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261114T180000
SUMMARY:Saturday Salsa Matinee | Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\nBest way to get a hold of us is
  on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU)\
 , also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\nA
 dmission includes:\n1-Hour Salsa Lesson\nSocial Dancing - DJ Geronimo's to
 p Salsa\, Bachata & Cha cha Latin hits.\n\nIt's an excellent opportunity t
 o practice and improve your dance to the tunes of world Salsa music by DJ 
 Geronimo and guest DJs. Have a favourite song ? We're also accepting music
  requests\nAtmosphere: Friendly and Laid back.\n\nDancers of all levels ar
 e welcome for social (No partner required)\nDoor: $10\n\nFREE LESSON (with
  admission to social dancing) 2pm\n\nSOCIAL DANCING 3-6pm\n\\*Please check
  calendar as in some rare occasions time changes slightly\n\nVenue: Tempo 
 Dance Collective – 1610a Bloor St W\, Toronto\n\nEveryone is welcome!\nJ
 oin our WhatsApp group:\n[https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrRJolhyD
 ](https://chat.whatsapp.com/KpFOsXEuXRWB7uOYorJNPU)\n\nHosts:\n\nMaya & Ga
 ry\nCanada SBK (Formerly TSF)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3171
 34080/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261025T181545Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261025T181545Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Salsa/Bachata/Kizomba GTA
UID:event_317152191@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261114T061840Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261115T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261115T220000
SUMMARY:Baila in the West Sunday Social
DESCRIPTION:Salsa | Bachata | Kizomba GTA\nBest way to get a hold of us is
  on our [WhatsApp chat](https://chat.whatsapp.com/Kj63TzHIqYL5hPrRJolhyD)\
 , also great way to join a community of amazing like-minded people :)\n\n*
 **Let's Dance!***\n***¡Vamos a bailar!***\n\n***DJ Geronimo 🎧 will be 
 playing your favorite Salsa 🎵 Bachata 🎶 Chacha 🎵 Merengue hits 
 🔊 DJ Sweetlike will be jamming in the Kizomba room***\n\nCover $10 befo
 re 7pm - $15 after 7pm - includes:\n***Free Bachata Lesson at 6:15pm with 
 entrance to event***\n***Dancing til 10pm***\n\n***\\*Casual dress code***
 \n***\\*Bring your own refreshments***\n\n***👠Please wear comfortable &
  clean shoes👞***\n\n**Location:**\n📍 40 Stavebank Rd N — Port Cred
 it Memorial Arena
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/salsa-bachata-kizomba-gta/events/3171
 52191/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261026T222214Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261026T222214Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
